Package: aquamusic
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AquaMusic <local@aquamusic.app>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libnss3, libasound2, libgbm1, libxkbcommon0, libegl1, libgl1
Description: AquaMusic local desktop music player
 A private local music player with optional HTTPS LAN sharing. Python and its
 dependencies are bundled in this package; no pip or internet connection is
 needed on the target computer.
